            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "This item contains raw data and metadata related to the manuscript \"Warm microhabitats drive both increased respiration and growth rates of intertidal consumers\" by Luke P. Miller, Bengt J. Allen, Felicia A. King, Daisy R. Chilin, Vanessa M. Reynoso, and Mark W. Denny. http://dx.doi.org/10.3354/meps11117\r\n\r\nIncluded are respiration measurements and associated size data for limpets included in the analysis of respiration rate versus temperature, in both aerial and aquatic conditions.",
